<title>UK: BNG sets 500 million guilder 15-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets 500 million guilder 15-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced</p>
<p>by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.125     MATURITY    07.MAY.12</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.565   PAY DATE    07.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    98.94     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-100-1M  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.375     SELL CONC  1.625     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND INTERPOLATED 7.5 PCT APR 10 AND JAN 23 DSL -- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
